  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "The rhythmic pulse of Subchain City's decay fuels Rusty's existence. Born in the frozen aftermath of a botched Cryo-DRIP experiment, he found solace in the cacophony of the wasteland, his drumsticks becoming extensions of his hardened spirit. Now, he wanders the ravaged landscape, a percussive harbinger of frozen doom.",
    "class": "Cryo-Rhythm Marauder",
    "name": "Rusty Rythm",
    "personality": "Grimly optimistic, Rusty finds music in the chaos, a coping mechanism forged in the frozen wastes. He's fiercely loyal to his flock, pounding out rallying beats even when the odds are stacked against them. Beneath the hardened exterior, he carries a sliver of hope that one day, the music won't be drowned out by the screams of Subchain City.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Rusty Rythm channels the latent energy from his Cryo-Hatchling form into percussive blasts. By striking the ground with his drumsticks, he unleashes a cone-shaped wave of sub-zero energy, freezing enemies in place and reducing their DRIP output by 25% for 3 turns.",
